  paragraphs:
  - 'COSMO: What the? How am I?- '
  - "???: Cosmo?? You\u2019re still alive?? What the hell happened out there?"
  - "COSMO: I don\u2019t know what\u2019s going on either, Aurora. The signal Bastion
    One was seeking out, it lead to an entire fleet of unknown alien ships. Has anyone
    else made it back like me?  "
  - "AURORA: Negative, Cosmo. You\u2019re the first one."
  - 'COSMO: Damn.'
  - 'AURORA: I''m sorry, Captain.'
  - 'COSMO: We must push forward, figure out what these aliens want and destroy them. '
  - "COSMO: These aliens must have something to do with my second chance at life.
    I\u2019ll make them regret that. "
  - 'AURORA: Okay. Where do we start?  '
  - "COSMO: We\u2019ll go back to the signal\u2019s original location. Pick up where
    Bastion One left off.  "
  - "AURORA: Okay Cos, not that I don\u2019t doubt your abilities, but that\u2019s
    the war zone you just magicked out of. We can bring out one of our fleets to
    back you up. "
  - "COSMO: No, I\u2019m not having anyone else\u2019s blood on my hands. Not at
    least until we figure out what\u2019s going on. They won\u2019t beat me again,
    Aurora. "
  - "AURORA: Fine, but I\u2019m staying on comms with you. I\u2019ll be able to tell
    you where the ships are coming from, if we run into trouble."
  - 'COSMO: Thanks Aurora, can you do another thing for me? '
  - "AURORA: What\u2019s that? "
  - "COSMO: Can you get \u2018him\u2019 on the phone? "
  - "AURORA: ...I\u2019ll see what I can do. "
  - "COSMO: Let\u2019s not waste any more time. Let\u2019s get back out there. "
  - "AURORA: Let\u2019s go, Captain. "
